WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.117
Let it plan today's lifts.

00:00:02.567 --> 00:00:09.719
Tap Build, then Build My Workout. Tell it your energy, what is sore, and your time.

00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:17.226
It builds the session in blocks. Sore muscles are avoided. You see the sets and the time up front.

00:00:17.667 --> 00:00:21.614
Dial any block lighter or heavier. The sets and time update.

00:00:22.067 --> 00:00:30.473
Then train one set at a time. The bar needs one hundred and thirteen kilos. The plates are worked out for you. No program needed.

00:00:30.933 --> 00:00:35.763
Download Barforge Weightlifting. No account. Free to start.
